cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this map or its processed data, please cite it as below, together with the underlying resources (STRING, UniProt, Human Protein Atlas, Reactome)."
title: "Human Interactome Map"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Haemmerli
    given-names: Leo
    affiliation: EPFL
repository-code: "https://github.com/lhaemmerli/human-interactome-map"
url: "https://lhaemmerli.github.io/human-interactome-map/"
abstract: >-
  Interactive map of 86,519 high-confidence physical protein-protein interactions
  between 10,746 human proteins (STRING v12), with filters by function, body system,
  disease and Reactome pathway, gene-list enrichment, path finding, 3D structures,
  domain-domain interfaces, disease mutations and drugs.
keywords:
  - protein-protein interactions
  - interactome
  - network biology
  - visualization
date-released: "2026-11-18"
